Cell["\<\
\:672c\:8282\:4f7f\:7528\:70b9\:72b6\:81ea\:65cb 1/2 Dirac \:9776 N\:ff0c\
\:76ee\:7684\:662f\:68c0\:67e5\:6697\:7269\:8d28\:8f90\:5c04\:90e8\:5206\:7684\
\:4e24\:5f20\:56fe\:3001\:4f20\:64ad\:5b50\:3001\:81ea\:65cb\:8ff9\:4ee5\:53ca\
