Cell["\<\
FeynRules \:6a21\:578b\:4e2d\:7684 WChiTwo \:662f\:5bbd\:5ea6\:53c2\:6570\
\:ff1b\:5bfc\:51fa\:6a21\:578b\:5e76\:4e0d\:4fdd\:8bc1\:5f53\:524d FeynArts\
\[RightArrow]FeynCalc \:632f\:5e45\:81ea\:52a8\:6309\:4e3b\:8ba1\:7b97\:7684\
\:6307\:5b9a\:65b9\:5f0f\:52a0\:5bbd\:5ea6\:3002\:672c\:8282\:5148\:6253\:5370\
 FCAMP\:ff08\:63d2\:5165\:5bbd\:5ea6\:524d\:ff09\:ff0c\:968f\:540e\:5bf9\:8f90\
\:5c04\:540e \[Chi]2 \:4f20\:64ad\:5b50\:663e\:5f0f\:66ff\:6362\:5e76\:6253\
\:5370 FCAMP_WITH_POLE_WIDTH\:ff1b\:53e6\:4e00\:4f20\:64ad\:5b50\:4fdd\:6301\
\:539f\:8868\:8fbe\:5f0f\:3002\[CapitalGamma] \:7531 Chi2Width \:5728\:5f53\
